--TEST--
signature help on a `switch` keyword answers none, since no method call and no attribute payload encloses the cursor, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`, `rule:ide/the-request-set-is-closed`
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $code = 1;
switc<|>h ($code) {
    case 1:
        echo "one";
        break;
    default:
        break;
}
--REQUEST--
signatureHelp
--EXPECT--
none
